# Only repo metadata is ignored. Everything else deploys, and every machine
# this repo targets is a Mac -- so there is no platform gating left anywhere in
# the tree: no .chezmoi.os conditionals, no uname guards, no dnf branch.
#
# Machine-specific behaviour is still handled where it executes, by probing for
# the thing rather than by branching on the host:
#   - dot_gitconfig.tmpl keys off `stat` of the x509 cert, so the Meta internal
#     endpoints appear only on a managed laptop.
#   - dot_zshrc aliases claude/codex to /usr/local/bin only when those exist.
#   - dot_zshrc defines `dc` only when the `dev` CLI is present.
# Add a probe to the file rather than an entry here.
